This removes wireless extensions over netlink as per feature removal
schedule.

Signed-off-by: Johannes Berg <johannes@sipsolutions.net>
---
Apparently the config symbol is already gone due to fixing up the
kconfig rework patch. Heh.

---
 Documentation/feature-removal-schedule.txt |   12 
 include/net/iw_handler.h                   |   10 
 net/core/rtnetlink.c                       |   30 -
 net/wireless/wext-old.c                    |  608 -----------------------------
 4 files changed, 660 deletions(-)

--- wireless-dev.orig/net/core/rtnetlink.c	2007-03-07 18:19:48.994699479 +0100
+++ wireless-dev/net/core/rtnetlink.c	2007-03-07 18:20:10.434699479 +0100
